- Now either you help me

1307
00:54:39,570 --> 00:54:41,080
or I'll be looking
someplace else.

1308
00:54:41,070 --> 00:54:42,070
- Well, I'm afraid
you're going to

1309
00:54:42,070 --> 00:54:43,570
