1310
00:54:45,580 --> 00:54:46,580
- Taxi, tax--?

1311
00:54:46,580 --> 00:54:49,080
Oh, I drove, I forgot.

1312
00:54:57,090 --> 00:54:59,590
- Okay, that's
I go to the bank,

1313
